  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kibagare Pad Project - Giving women Dignity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Many women and girls in our community struggle with coping with their monthly periods. Many have no access to sanitary pads or clean water, and are faced with taboos and customs that discourage and or look down on issues relating to the menstrual cycle every month. Kibagare Pad Project aims to bring Compostible Sanitary Pads to the community and help educate, support and guide women, not only with their monthly cycle, but also with female health, education and provide Dignity Packs.</narrative>
  </description>
